{"text": "It was terribly cold, and snow was falling on the city. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was getting dark on the last night of the year. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the cold and dark, a poor little girl was walking in the street. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had no hat, and her feet were bare. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When she left home, she was wearing her mothers old slippers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They were much bigger than her small feet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She lost them when she ran across the street to escape two fast carriages. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A boy ran away with one slipper, and she could not find the other. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now her little feet were red and blue with cold. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was carrying a lot of matches in her old apron. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All day long, nobody bought a single match from her.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "t", "e", "r", "r", "i", "b", "l", "y", " ", "c", "o", "l", "d", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "n", "o", "w", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "f", "a", "l", "l", "i", "n", "g", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "i", "t", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "g", "e", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "d", "a", "r", "k", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "o", "l", "d", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "d", "a", "r", "k", ",", " ", "a", " ", "p", "o", "o", "r", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "g", "i", "r", "l", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "w", "a", "l", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "r", "e", "e", "t", ".", " ", "<",